  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 05d4c58a8777a554f9643c64e852e28a, type: 3}
  m_Name: Data_MarcusFenix
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CharacterData
  characterNameEN: Marcus Fenix
  characterNameES: Marcus Fenix
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  sceneName: Marcus Fenix
  originEN: Marcus Fenix is a soldier of the Coalition of Ordered Governments (COG)
    on the planet Sera and the main protagonist of the Gears of War series, first
    released in 2006. A veteran of the Pendulum Wars, he is the son of scientist
    Adam Fenix and a member of Delta Squad.
  originES: "Marcus Fenix es un soldado de la Coalici\xF3n de Gobiernos Ordenados
    (COG) en el planeta Sera y el protagonista principal de la saga Gears of War,
    lanzada en 2006. Veterano de las Guerras del P\xE9ndulo, es hijo del cient\xEDfico
    Adam Fenix y miembro del Escuadr\xF3n Delta."
  historyEN: Marcus was imprisoned for leaving his post during the Battle of Aspho
    Fields to try to save his father. When the Locust Horde emerges from underground
    on Emergence Day, his old friend Dom Santiago frees him to help humanity fight
    back. Over the trilogy he leads the war against the Locust and the Lambent, and
    in later games he faces new threats alongside his family.
  historyES: "Marcus fue encarcelado por abandonar su puesto durante la Batalla de
    Aspho Fields para intentar salvar a su padre. Cuando la Horda Locust surge del
    subsuelo en el D\xEDa de la Emergencia, su viejo amigo Dom Santiago lo libera
    para ayudar a la humanidad a defenderse. A lo largo de la trilog\xEDa lidera
    la guerra contra los Locust y los Lambent, y en juegos posteriores enfrenta nuevas
    amenazas junto a su familia."
  abilitiesEN: A veteran soldier with great physical strength, tactical skill and
    leadership. He fights using cover, and his signature weapons are the Lancer assault
    rifle, with its chainsaw bayonet, and the Gnasher shotgun. He also handles heavy
    and support weapons such as the Hammer of Dawn.
  abilitiesES: "Soldado veterano con gran fuerza f\xEDsica, habilidad t\xE1ctica
    y liderazgo. Combate usando coberturas, y sus armas insignia son el rifle de
    asalto Lancer, con su motosierra de bayoneta, y la escopeta Gnasher. Tambi\xE9n
    maneja armas pesadas y de apoyo como el Martillo del Amanecer."
  universeEN: The story takes place on Sera, a planet devastated by war. After the
    Pendulum Wars, which were fought over the energy resource Imulsion, humanity
    faces the Locust Horde, a subterranean enemy. The series later introduces the
    Lambent and the Swarm, and follows a struggle for survival among the ruins of
    human civilization.
  universeES: "La historia transcurre en Sera, un planeta devastado por la guerra.
    Tras las Guerras del P\xE9ndulo, libradas por el recurso energ\xE9tico Imulsi\xF3n,
    la humanidad enfrenta a la Horda Locust, un enemigo subterr\xE1neo. La saga introduce
    despu\xE9s a los Lambent y al Enjambre, y sigue una lucha por sobrevivir entre
    las ruinas de la civilizaci\xF3n humana."
  creatorsEN: Created by Epic Games, with Cliff Bleszinski as lead designer, and
    published by Microsoft Game Studios for Xbox 360. Microsoft acquired the franchise
    in 2014, and it has since been developed by The Coalition. Marcus Fenix is voiced
    by John DiMaggio.
  creatorsES: "Creado por Epic Games, con Cliff Bleszinski como dise\xF1ador principal,
    y publicado por Microsoft Game Studios para Xbox 360. Microsoft adquiri\xF3 la
    franquicia en 2014, y desde entonces la desarrolla The Coalition. Marcus Fenix
    tiene la voz de John DiMaggio."
  culturalImpactEN: Gears of War (2006) helped popularize the cover-based third-person
    shooter and became one of the flagship franchises of the Xbox 360, showcasing
    the power of Unreal Engine 3. Marcus Fenix became one of Xbox's most recognizable
    characters, and the franchise expanded into novels, comics and spin-offs.
  culturalImpactES: "Gears of War (2006) ayud\xF3 a popularizar el shooter en tercera
    persona basado en coberturas y se convirti\xF3 en una de las franquicias insignia
    de la Xbox 360, mostrando el potencial del Unreal Engine 3. Marcus Fenix pas\xF3
    a ser uno de los personajes m\xE1s reconocibles de Xbox, y la franquicia se expandi\xF3
    a novelas, c\xF3mics y spin-offs."
